   "_id": 36280,
   "ANSWER": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><i>Happiness is a state of contentment and inner satisfaction, while prosperity refers to the feeling of having sufficient physical facilities to meet basic needs.</i></span></span></span></p>\n",
